msgstr "Plot"

#: guis/GUI03_Fiber_Height_Histogram.py:1539
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{histogram} は 1 群の分布の形を示します。{ecdf} は累積分布を重ねて描くため、ビン幅に依存せずに群を比較できます。{box} "
"は各群の中央値と四分位数を並べて要約します。{ecdf} と {box} は常に重ね／並置表示になるため、縦並び・重ね表示の選択は使われません。"
msgstr ""
"{histogram} shows the shape of one group's distribution. {ecdf} overlays "
"the cumulative distributions, so groups can be compared without depending"
" on a bin width. {box} summarises each group's median and quartiles side "
"by side. {ecdf} and {box} always place every group on one axes, so the "
"stacked/overlaid choice is unused."

