msgid "CSVで保存"
msgstr "Save as CSV"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:775
msgid "選択を除外"
msgstr "Exclude selected"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:779
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"選択中のファイバーを計測・CSV 出力の対象から外します。反映は即座ですが、バンドル横の {suffix} "
"への書き出しは「除外を保存」を押したときだけ行われます。自動フィルターでは落とせないゴミや走査線アーティファクトを、全体像で確認しながら除くための機能です。"
msgstr ""
"Drop the selected fiber from measurement and CSV export. The views update"
" at once, but the write to {suffix} beside the bundle happens only when "
"\"Save exclusions\" is pressed. It is how debris and scan-line artifacts "
"that no automatic filter can remove get excluded, while you look at them "
"in the overview."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:786
msgid "直前を取消"
msgstr "Undo last"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:791
msgid "最後に行った除外を取り消します。繰り返し押すと、追加した逆順にさかのぼって取り消せます。"
msgstr ""
"Undo the most recent exclusion. Press it repeatedly to walk back through "
"the exclusions in reverse order."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:805
msgid "除外設定..."
msgstr "Exclusion settings..."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:810
msgid "このデータセットの除外を一覧し、任意の 1 件または全件を解除します。解除もファイルへ書き出すには「除外を保存」が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"List this dataset's exclusions and restore any one of them, or all. "
"Restoring also needs \"Save exclusions\" to reach the file."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:815
msgid "除外を保存"
msgstr "Save exclusions"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:819
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"現在の除外をバンドル横の {suffix} へ書き出します。除外が 1 "
"件も無い状態で保存すると、そのファイルは削除されます。未保存の変更があるときだけ押せます。"
msgstr ""
"Write the current exclusions to {suffix} beside the bundle. Saving with "
"nothing excluded removes that file. Enabled only while there are unsaved "
"changes."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:889
msgid "選択へズーム"
msgstr "Zoom to Selection"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:893
msgid ""
"選択中のファイバーが画面いっぱいになるまで拡大します。\n"
"表示範囲外のファイバーを選んだ場合は自動で表示範囲へ入りますが、\n"
"拡大率は変わりません。"
msgstr ""
"Zooms in until the selected fiber fills the view.\n"
"Selecting a fiber outside the visible region brings it into view "
"automatically, but does not change the zoom level."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:898
msgid "番号・枠"
msgstr "Numbers & Boxes"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:904
msgid ""
"各ファイバーの番号と破線枠の表示を切り替えます。\n"
"OFF にすると全体像の再描画が目に見えて速くなるため、\n"
"拡大・移動の操作が重いときに有効です。\n"
"選択中ファイバーの黄色い枠は常に表示されます。"
msgstr ""
"Toggles the per-fiber numbers and dashed boxes.\n"
"Turning them off makes the overview redraw noticeably faster, which helps"
" when zooming and panning feel slow.\n"
"The yellow box on the selected fiber is always shown."

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:926
msgid "AFM 全体像"
msgstr "AFM Overview"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:939
msgid "ファイバー色分け"
msgstr "Color-coded fibers"

#: guis/GUI04_Tracking_fiber.py:945
msgid ""
"各ファイバーを個別色で二値化像上に散布表示します。\n"
"どの骨格がひとつのフィブリルに繋がったかを一目で確認でき、\n"
"ファイバー連結の結果検証に有効です。"
msgstr ""
"Scatters each fiber in its own color over the binarized image.\n"
"See at a glance which skeleton fragments joined into one fibril —\n"
"useful for verifying the fiber-connection result."

